You have to remove all chests from the level and have to carry some
gold, else you will create no monster. I recommend also engraving two
concentric rings of Elbereth with cursed objects on them because
monsters are much less likely to use powerful wands when you keep them
in melee range. The good part is the throne is never destroyed.

I believe throne rooms never contain an altar, so it might be a bit of
work to sacrifice the monsters. At least you get lots and lots of
defensive/offensive wands, potions, and scrolls. Add dragon scales if
you are below dungeon level 13.


